  sig=func (s *Store) ListTransfersSince(ctx context.Context, sinceSeq int64, limit int) ([]TransferSummary, error)
  doc=ListTransfersSince returns transfers with seq > sinceSeq in ASCENDING seq\norder (capped at limit) — the replay query the SSE stream uses to backfill a\nreconnecting client from its Last-Event-ID before resuming the live tail.
EDGES
  ^contains=github.com/paxlabs-inc/layerx/internal/store.Store
  ^defines=github.com/paxlabs-inc/layerx/internal/store/explorer.go

