  doc=RegisterDIDClaim records the keccak256(did) -> did mapping the deposit watcher\nuses to reverse an on-chain Deposit `did` bytes32 back to the off-chain DID.\nIdempotent: the same claim always maps to the same DID, so a re-register is a\nno-op (the DID is refreshed defensively in case of a label change).
EDGES
  ^contains=github.com/paxlabs-inc/layerx/internal/store.Store
  ^defines=github.com/paxlabs-inc/layerx/internal/store/chain.go

