  sig=func (s *Store) ResolveDIDClaim(ctx context.Context, claim string) (string, error)
  doc=ResolveDIDClaim returns the DID a claim maps to, or ErrNotFound when the claim\nwas never registered (an unrecognized deposit the watcher cannot attribute).
